			"Message": "test(Maintain): Refactor integration test helpers and assertions\n\nInline helper functions in integration tests for consistent style and reduced verbosity. Refactor the helper functions in `Integration.rs` to improve clarity and reduce verbosity.\n\nThe helper functions `transform`, `transform_with`, `norm`, `assert_eliminates`, and `assert_unchanged` now have access to `Opts` for configuration.\n\nThis maintains test correctness while reducing the code duplication in the test definitions. No breaking changes to test logic.",
